flowchart LR
		USER[Browser Client] -->|HTTP :3000| FE[Frontend Container\nNginx + SPA]

		FE -->|/api/*, /uploads/* proxy| BE[Backend Container\nFastAPI Uvicorn]
		BE -->|Motor async driver| MDB[(MongoDB Container)]
		BE -->|queue/cache calls| R[(Redis Container)]

		BE -. optional task publish .-> R
		CW[Celery Worker Container\noptional scale-out service] -->|consume jobs| R
		CW -->|persist side-effects| MDB
